{
    "title": "SupportPay: Split Expenses",
    "description": "SupportPay is a revolutionary app designed for families including, single, divorced, co-parents, step-parents, pet parents, caregivers, eldercare, and anytime family members need to seamlessly manage, split and share, expenses, payments, and reimbursements. \r\n\r\nWith SupportPay, users can effortlessly manage, share, and track various expenses, ensuring transparent communication and financial management among family members. \r\n\r\nTrusted by tens of thousands of users, SupportPay is the original, highly secure platform tailored to address the unique needs of caregivers.\r\n\r\nKEY FEATURES:\r\n\r\nADD MULTIPLE FAMILIES: Users can manage multiple parent/child relationships or share expenses with other family members by adding an unlimited number of families, each independently managed.\r\n\r\nADD MORE THAN 2 PEOPLE AS USERS: SupportPay allows users to add an unlimited number of family members or users to their accounts, facilitating financial collaboration and responsibility sharing.\r\n\r\nBILL PAY: Users can upload bills and send payments directly to merchants or third parties. SupportPay also enables users to send checks directly from the app, eliminating payment uncertainties and reimbursement issues.\r\n\r\nEFFORTLESS EXPENSE MANAGEMENT: Easily add, view, and save expenses, payments, receipts, and payment proof. SupportPay's receipt scanning technology automates expense entry by capturing and storing data from uploaded receipts.\r\n\r\nIMPORT OLD EXPENSES: Users can migrate existing financial data into the app, saving time and eliminating manual data entry.\r\n\r\nSTREAMLINED CONFLICT RESOLUTION: Resolve financial disagreements through advanced conflict management methods. SupportPay provides a platform to review, dispute, and resolve conflicts, ensuring smooth payment processes.\r\n\r\nSECURE PAYMENT OPTIONS: Send and receive payments securely via bank transfers or PayPal while maintaining account data privacy. SupportPay accommodates various payment methods, including cash, credit cards, checks, and state systems.\r\n\r\nCUSTOMIZABLE EXPENSE TRACKING: Tailor expense tracking to individual needs by customizing categories, merchants, and tracking by family members.\r\n\r\nCERTIFIED LEGAL RECORDS: Store, save, export, and print legally admissible records for court, tax, or other purposes, ensuring compliance with legal requirements.\r\n\r\nSEAMLESS TRACKING: Use SupportPay individually for personal tracking and certified record-keeping, or collaborate with family members for automatic tracking, payments, dispute resolution, and transparency.\r\n\r\nBenefits of Using SupportPay:\r\n\r\n- Transparency and Fairness: Promotes transparency and fairness by enabling all parties to easily track expenses, payments, and contributions.\r\n\r\n- Streamlined Communication: Provides a centralized platform for effective communication and discussion of financial matters, reducing miscommunication and confusion.\r\n\r\n- Organizational Efficiency: Helps users stay organized and in control of their finances through intuitive features and tools, saving time and reducing stress.\r\n\r\n- Legal Compliance: Ensures compliance with legal requirements and court orders by providing accurate and detailed expense and payment records.\r\n\r\nDownload SupportPay today to take control of your financial caregiving journey!\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: SupportPay is an independent application for managing child support and sharing expenses directly among parents, caregivers, and family members. It is not associated with any state or government child support service or agency, nor is it an enforcement agency. Users seeking the status of child support payments from the state should visit their state child support agency's website.",
    "descriptionHTML": "SupportPay is a revolutionary app designed for families including, single, divorced, co-parents, step-parents, pet parents, caregivers, eldercare, and anytime family members need to seamlessly manage, split and share, expenses, payments, and reimbursements. <br><br>With SupportPay, users can effortlessly manage, share, and track various expenses, ensuring transparent communication and financial management among family members. <br><br>Trusted by tens of thousands of users, SupportPay is the original, highly secure platform tailored to address the unique needs of caregivers.<br><br>KEY FEATURES:<br><br>ADD MULTIPLE FAMILIES: Users can manage multiple parent/child relationships or share expenses with other family members by adding an unlimited number of families, each independently managed.<br><br>ADD MORE THAN 2 PEOPLE AS USERS: SupportPay allows users to add an unlimited number of family members or users to their accounts, facilitating financial collaboration and responsibility sharing.<br><br>BILL PAY: Users can upload bills and send payments directly to merchants or third parties. SupportPay also enables users to send checks directly from the app, eliminating payment uncertainties and reimbursement issues.<br><br>EFFORTLESS EXPENSE MANAGEMENT: Easily add, view, and save expenses, payments, receipts, and payment proof. SupportPay&#39;s receipt scanning technology automates expense entry by capturing and storing data from uploaded receipts.<br><br>IMPORT OLD EXPENSES: Users can migrate existing financial data into the app, saving time and eliminating manual data entry.<br><br>STREAMLINED CONFLICT RESOLUTION: Resolve financial disagreements through advanced conflict management methods. SupportPay provides a platform to review, dispute, and resolve conflicts, ensuring smooth payment processes.<br><br>SECURE PAYMENT OPTIONS: Send and receive payments securely via bank transfers or PayPal while maintaining account data privacy. SupportPay accommodates various payment methods, including cash, credit cards, checks, and state systems.<br><br>CUSTOMIZABLE EXPENSE TRACKING: Tailor expense tracking to individual needs by customizing categories, merchants, and tracking by family members.<br><br>CERTIFIED LEGAL RECORDS: Store, save, export, and print legally admissible records for court, tax, or other purposes, ensuring compliance with legal requirements.<br><br>SEAMLESS TRACKING: Use SupportPay individually for personal tracking and certified record-keeping, or collaborate with family members for automatic tracking, payments, dispute resolution, and transparency.<br><br>Benefits of Using SupportPay:<br><br>- Transparency and Fairness: Promotes transparency and fairness by enabling all parties to easily track expenses, payments, and contributions.<br><br>- Streamlined Communication: Provides a centralized platform for effective communication and discussion of financial matters, reducing miscommunication and confusion.<br><br>- Organizational Efficiency: Helps users stay organized and in control of their finances through intuitive features and tools, saving time and reducing stress.<br><br>- Legal Compliance: Ensures compliance with legal requirements and court orders by providing accurate and detailed expense and payment records.<br><br>Download SupportPay today to take control of your financial caregiving journey!<br><br>Disclaimer: SupportPay is an independent application for managing child support and sharing expenses directly among parents, caregivers, and family members. It is not associated with any state or government child support service or agency, nor is it an enforcement agency. Users seeking the status of child support payments from the state should visit their state child support agency&#39;s website.",
